{"query": "{\"issue\": \"delete() on instances of models without any dependencies doesn't clear PKs.\\nDescription\\n\\t\\nDeleting any model with no dependencies not updates the PK on the model. It should be set to None after .delete() call.\\nSee Django.db.models.deletion:276-281. Should update the model line 280.\\n\"}", "user_id": "e12b9a3a-c993-4193-b203-2ac6909c29cb", "event": "API: Searching code", "logger": "synsc.api.http_server", "level": "info", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T16:06:39.849338Z"}
